n's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","review_id":"iG32m0vnjTuW17aeQRUtaQ","date":"2019-03-18T23:06:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9451895356178284,"text_excerpt":"This was the first place that we ate at upon arriving to NOLA. It was right around the corner from our hotel and we were starving! Luckily we got seated right away. I started with Gumbo, of course. It was really good but the highlight of my day was the shrimp po' boy that I got. OMG so delicious. The shrimp were so crunchy and flavorful and the bread was just perfect. The french fries were really good too. The only thing that my sandwich needed was a bit more sauce. My friend got the Muffaletta sandwich and she was just in heaven. The waitress was really helpful with her because she actually has a seafood allergy, so she went over what had seafood and how it was cooked, etc. We also stopp..."},{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","review_id":"jUBHuaG8QWF-1J98iBoSbQ","date":"2021-04-14T17:01:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9368075132369995,"text_excerpt":"My friend and I randomly picked this restaurant to have lunch during our trip to New Orleans and we loved it. Let's dive right in: Gulf shrimp yaya - the pesto is nice and creamy, shrimp were fresh and bouncy, it was perfect on toasted bread. A delicious starter. Blacked chicken jambalaya - my friend loved it. I had a bite and the rice was very well cooked and super flavorful. Creole Stuffed Fish - loved the crawfish dressing, my fish was perfectly cooked. I really enjoyed the sugar snap peas on my plate, it was a nice break from everything else heavy. And you can't ever go wrong with mashed potatoes. Pecan cobbler - dear God this was so good. The warm cobbler and cold ice cream, name me ..."},{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","review_id":"iKSufkWhvjOi9ioxslesVw","date":"2019-06-21T20:10:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9345055818557739,"text_excerpt":"First place we ate on our trip. It's got good food! The staff is fun, they have a good beer selection, but I think there are a lot of cheaper options around. It's got an interesting vibe in there and you should definitely check the place out even if just for a beer. I'm not well versed in NOLA food but I enjoyed everything that I ate, and so did my family! Thankfully someone else in the party picked up the check - a bit too expensive for me to go out of my way to return. Thanks for the great dinner!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","photo_id":"Y1dk7OdNh0YtbjtkunYv2g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Y1dk7OdNh0YtbjtkunYv2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8623753786087036},{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","photo_id":"7rSBNuF2xirDNvENpqRGgg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7rSBNuF2xirDNvENpqRGgg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8400430083274841},{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","photo_id":"ri8JWC2Cu6hYyQCFcI19QA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ri8JWC2Cu6hYyQCFcI19QA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8392560482025146},{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","photo_id":"Y-2zJsGBZeQqeyylhr-dHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Y-2zJsGBZeQqeyylhr-dHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8169840574264526},{"business_id":"S2Ho8yLxhKAa26pBAm6rxA","photo_id":"rMt588jN8SSMBDCNQuYsuA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/rMt588jN8SSMBDCNQuYsuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7830470204353333}]},"notebook_case":null}
